mighty hammer kelrarin~
The hammer is a remarkably ordinary looking weapon.  It is essentially a
large round-headed hammer that looks much like a common carpenters
mallet.  Its only noteworthy feature is that it is made entirely from
coal-black iron.  Even the handle is iron, patterned after wood grain
so that it resembles a common item.  It is very heavy.  Only a small
magical rune at the end of the hammer gives it away as a magical artifact.
Beneath it is carved a single name, 'Kelrarin'.
~
