man statue~
&+B   Here is a preserved yet living version of a man, kept for some personal
&+Breason of Vareena's. He is tall, dark haired and built with welcoming arms.
&+BHe has a warm, contageous smile and holds his gaze in any direction that
&+Bone may move. Overwhelmingly beautiful, white wings are spread out from
&+Bbehind him. Each perfectly grown, downy feather is surrounded by its own
&+Bsoft glow. As there are hundreds of these, he stands as bright as a star.
&+BThere is something magical about this man. He seems to communicate a deep
&+Bknowing and healing love from within, without making a sound. There is a
&+Btiny &+bband&+B on the man's finger that hums and glows a faint blue aura.&N
~
