chest wooden large~
This large wooden chest is about three feet long, two feet deep and just
over two feet wide. The wood appears to be at least partially cedar, the
aroma helping keep insects from the contents, and bound with pieces of
fitted iron. A latch and catch are on the container, so it could be
padlocked shut if the proper lock were obtained. Additionally, the sides
of the chest are fitted with large metal handles, allowing the chest to be
more easily carried.
~
