&+LThe armor succeeded in its task, along with its sister items, a helm,
&+Land a mighty warhammer. However, as all great things progress, it was not meant
&+Lto be forever, so one fateful day, while laying waste to the &+MMindflayers&+L
&+Linside the caverns of &+rKhildarak&+L, they combined their mental energies,
&+Ltrapping &+wStrongstone&+L in the cavern, left to die to the ravages of age and
&+Ldisease. This armor glows with a fearsome light, and seems to have a strange power
&+Lto conform to the size of any body, from the tiniest goblin to the largest ogre.
