&+BGeneral Information:&N
&+b-------------------&N
Includes: Barbarian Locations on Duris, Typical Barbarian
          Personalities ............................................. Page1

&+BRacial Appearance:&N
&+b------------------&N
Includes: Age Lifespans, Typical Body Structure, Eyes/Hair Color,
          Average Height and Weight ................................. Page2

&+BGame Mechanics:&N
&+b---------------&N
Includes: Allowable Classes, Barbarian Innate Abilities, Languages
          Information, Barbarian Statistics ......................... Page3
~
E
page1 1~
&+BGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+B-------------------&N
Barbarians are a primative human subrace, typically living sheltered,
supersticious lives within small clan or village settings. Most
barbarians tend to be extremely wary of outsiders, to the point of
parinoia and hostility, especially when witnessing displays of foreign
magic or religion. Many barbarian tribes have deeply ingrained
traditions of taboo, kindred with animal spirits, religious ceremonies,
and strong tribal unity, all of which can inhibit their ability to
travel with people who have different beliefs.
~
E
page2 2~
&+BRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+B-----------------&N
The following information is provided primarily for purposes of setting
character descriptions or for those interested in roleplaying.

As a human sub-race, barbarians reach maturity in their teenage years,
and can live to be around 100 years old. Their body builds tend to be
highly variable, with the common arctic peoples having bulky forms with
dark, windblown complexions and abnormal amount of hair. Eye color is
highly variable, with blue, brown and green being common. Hair is often
worn long, with black, brown, blonde and red being typical colors. When
compared to more 'civilized' humans, barbarians are often taller, with
males averaging around 7'0" and females 6'5". Similarly, their weights
are larger with 220lbs. being average for males and 180lbs. average for
females.
~
E
page3 3~
&+BGAME MECHANICS&N
&+B--------------&N
For information on these subjects, peruse the following help options:

HELP BARBARIAN, HELP INNATE, HELP BODYSLAM, HELP RACES, HELP LANGUAGES,
and HELP SPEAK
~
