          Information, Drow Elf Statistics .......................... Page3
~
E
page1 1~
&+mGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+m-------------------&N
Drow elves, also known as dark or night elves, are the most evil and
sinister of all the elven subraces. They are the antithesis of the good and
tranquil surface world elves, worshipping demonesses and evil elemental
gods in their underground cities. From this worship, drow tend to be
extremely devious and chaotic, making them even more feared by other races.
Millennia ago in a great war which split the elven races, the drow were
driven into the blackness of the Underdark, where they have developed their
own cruel society..building it on a hatred of their distant elven cousins.

Currently, the drow elves of Duris are found deep in the Underdark within
their stronghold city of Arachdrathos.
~
E
page2 2~
&+mRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+m-----------------&N
The following information is provided primarily for purposes of setting
character descriptions or for those interested in roleplaying.

Similar to the other elven subraces, drow elves are a long lived race. Those
lucky enough to survive the chaos of the Underdark can live to be over 475
years old and are considered mature adults around the age of eighty. Drow
have a lithe, slim and graceful body build, with elongated features and
pointed ears. Their skin is usually jet black, an occasional albino being the
exception, and they normally sport white, silver or copper colored hair and
eyes of red, black, green or brown. Unlike most races, drow females are of
sturdier build, averaging 5'2" tall and 110 lbs, while males tend to be a
couple of inches shorter and 10-15 lbs lighter.
~
E
page3 3~
