page1 1~
&+GGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+G-------------------&N
Half-elves are not, techincally speaking, a race but rather the offspring
of the union of an elf and human (half-elvesmating with half-elves will
produce half-elves though). Half-elves tend to have traits from both parents
and often face racism and severe psycological problems in either society.
Many half-elves travel back and forth between elven and human societies,
enjoying life as it comes to them.
~
E
page2 2~
&+GRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+G-----------------&N
Half-elves can live to be approximately 155 years old, reaching maturity in
the mid to late teenage years. This causes them some difficulty, as they are
longer lived that humans and shorter lived than elves, adding to their
feelings as an outcast race. Half-elves are generally slightly larger than
elves, due to their human heritage, but retain many of the elongated features
of their elven parents. However, most half-elves do not have pointed ears.
Their eyes and hair are highly variable in color, as per humans, with brown,
black, and red being common. Males average around 5'6" and 128 lbs, while
females tend to be slightly smaller at an average of 5'4" and 103 lbs.
~
E
