page1 1~
&+YGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+Y-------------------&N
Halflings are a race of diminuative humanoids, which appear much as human
children do and live in a manner akin to that of humans. Although not
particularly industrious, halflings have an ingenuity that makes their lack-
luster efforts yield excellent results. Theit typical crafts tend towards the
ordinairy and the mundane, such as farming, banking, innskeeping, and the
merchant trade. halflings also take great pleasure in nature and prefer to live
in pastorial countrysides, with a mixture of cottages and underground burrows
for dwellings. Their most well known feature is a tendency towards mischecious
and good-natured playfulness.
~
E
page2 2~
&+YRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+Y-----------------&N
In general, halflings may be considered mature adults around the age of 20 and
may live to be over 150 years old in some rare cases. They tend to have a
rotund appearance, with ruddy complexions, making them appear much like human
children. Eye color is typically blue or hazel, and hair color is almost always
some shade of brown, from sandy to dark brown. Males and females are of
comparable heights and weights, being on average about 3'3" and 60 pounds.
~
E
