page1 1~
&+YGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+Y-------------------&N
Humans are the dominant race in the land of Duris, the most successful
race dominating the vast reaches of the world. Found in nearly every
corner of the land, humans are a varied and undefinable race. Human beings
have a broad range of talents and interests, making each one who decides
on a life of adventure a very unique personality. Bandits, nomads,
farmers, merchants, pirates, adventurers and even cavemen hunters are
examples of human occupations within their diverse societies.

Currently on Duris, the most concentrated populations of humans can be
found near the great city of Verzanan. However, humans are a rugged race
and can be found nearly anywhere on the continent of Elkenshaul.~
E
page2 2~
&+YRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+Y-----------------&N
Human beings can live to be around 100 years old and they reach maturity
in the mid to late teenage years. Humans come in a variety of body builds
and skin tones, which is examplary of the diversity of the race. Eye color
is highly variable, with blue, brown and green being common. Similarly,
hair color is difficult to predict, with shades of brown, black, red and
blonde often seen. Males tend to be taller (average 5'10") and heavier
(average 170#) than females (average 5'7" and 130#), although there are
often extreme exceptions to these averages.
~
E
page3 3~
