page1 1~
&+mGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+m-------------------&N
Mind flayers, also known as Illithids, are a powerful and feared race of the
Underdark, taken to enslaving other races even those as powerful as Drow or
Kuo-Toa. They are extremely arrogant, viewing all other races as cattle to be
fed upon or enslaved. Mind flayers have no social or family structure, their
only concerns being eating, plotting to control the whole of the Underdark and
communication with the communiy through the Elder-Brain (a central telepathic
link between members of an illithid community). Illithids hate sunlight like
most Underdark races, and choose to live in underground cities upkept by their
many slaves.

On Duris, Illithids currently reside deep in the Underdark in the city of
Ixarkon.
~
E
page2 2~
&+mRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+m-----------------&N
Illithids begin life in a tadpole stage, reared in a pool with the elder brain,
after ten years they emerge as mature adults and can live to be approximately
125 years old. Mind flayers have a mauve-colored skin that glistens with slime.
>From their octopus-like heads sprout four tentacles which are used to attach
the creature to humanoid skulls and draw forth brain matter, upon which they
feed. Their hands have three fingers and a thumb, all with a reddish color.
their eyes are totally white, with no evident pupils and they have no
distinctive growths of hair. Illithids average about 6'0" in height, but only
around 100 pounds in weight, indicating the frailness of their body frame.
Illithids have no sexes, all are hemaphoditic.
~
E
page3 3~
