&+gGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+g-------------------&N
Grey elves are a xenophobic race that likes to keep to themselves.  Though they
tolerate the other surface races of the world, they tend to travel alone or
with others of their kind.  Their culture is one that embraces nature and the
natural world.  They enjoy the arts and skills that come from long practice,
such as archery and musical talents.
~
E
page2 2~
&+gRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+g-----------------&N
Grey elves can easily live to be over 550 years old and young adults around
110 years old are the ones normally seen adventuring. Grey elves tend to be
slender, with pale skin, elongated features and pointed ears. They typically
have blur or green eyes, spotted with golden flecks. Their hair is often
silvery-blue, black or blue, but any color is possible. Males tend to be
taller (5'0") and heavier (90-120 lbs) than females (4'7" and 70-100 lbs).
~
E
