page1 1~
&+LGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+L-------------------&N
Dwarfs are a hardy, unyielding race who prefer living in beautiful mountain
fortresses built of carved stone. Within these cities they practice their crafts
of metallurgy, stone working, and mining to perfection. Most dwarven settlements
are organized into a clan system, usually specializing in one trade or skill.
Good-natured, despite their perpetual grumpiness, dwarves fight chaos and evil
with extraordinairy vigor, putting their finely crafted weapons and armor to
good use.
~
E
page2 2~
&+LRACIAL APPEARANCES&N
&+L------------------&N
Dwarves are considered mature adults around 50 and can live to be nearly 400
years old. They are a short, stout race with generally light brown or greyish
skill color, very similar to the earth and rock they work with. Their eyes
have a bright sheen to them and are often blue or brown. Dwarves wear their
hair long and it is usually colored brown, black or grey. Most dwarves also
maintain well groomed beards and mustaches, considering them a source of pride.
Average heights for dwarves are 4'6" (males) and 4'4 (females), while weights
average 170 lbs for males and 140 lbs for females.
~
E
page3 3~
&+LGAME MECHANICS&N
