page1 1~
&+GGENERAL INFORMATION&N
&+G-------------------&N
Trolls are a race distantly akin to the goblinoids and are typically found in
marshy caves, dense forests, subterranean areas and abandoned ruins, living in
small hunting packs. However variations of the common 'swamp troll' can be found
in nearly any climate, from arctic to desert. Irregardless of the type of troll,
the race is known for its ferocity, fearlessness and nearly perpetual hunger.
Trolls prefer to avoid daylight and hunt at night, although sunlight causes them
naught but irritation. Trolls appear quite ape-like when they move, walking with
hunched shoulders in a knuckle-dragging gait while they search out prey to
satisfy their ravenous appetites.
~
E
page2 2~
&+GRACIAL APPEARANCE&N
&+G-----------------&N
Trolls can live to be slightly over 100 years old, coming into adulthood
at about 15. Trolls appear very thin and frail, with a rubbery hide which
is colored in green, grey or a mottled green-grey. Their legs and arms are
long and ungainly, but quite strong. Troll eyes are typically sunken and
black, while their hair is a greenish-black to grey writhing mass. Average
heights are 9'0" (males) and 10'0" (females), with average weights being
220 lbs (males) and 250 lbs (females).
~
E
