resin satchel ocularius~
&n   This &+csatchel&n contains the rubbery, white &+Wresin&n of the &+gO&+Gcu&+gl&+Ga&+gri&+Gu&+gs&n plant.  The
&ngum-like substance is pliable and highly sticky to the touch, leaving behind a
&+Wwhite&n build-up on the fingertips that is itself very tacky.  It is this quality
&nand the pliability of the &+Wresin&n that denotes its age.
~
