E
kola heirloom blue haze~
&n   Similar to Black &+mK&+Lu&+ms&+Lh&n in that its psychoactive constituents reside in the
&nblue, hair-like &+ctrichomes&n that form on the loose grouping of &+Ccalyces&n that form
&nan airy but sizeable kola; the largest and topmost fruiting bud on the plant.
&nThe &+cp&+Cl&+ca&+Cn&+ct&n does produce smaller buds ranging from popcorn-size up to &+cnuggets&n
&nweighing five to seven grams.  These, however, tend to be of lesser quality in
&nthe heirloom version of Blue &+CH&+ca&+Cz&+ce&n.  The calyx clusters give readily between the
&nfingers and can be broken up by vigorously rolling the &+Ckola&n repeatedly between
&nthe palms of the hands.  It is these &+cgrounds&n that one uses to smoke.
~
