E
batch landrace medicus~
&n   This batch of &+GMe&+cd&+Gi&+ccu&+Gs&n consists of about five &+ybranches&n and their accompanying
&+Gle&+ca&+Gv&+ces&n.  Tied with a span of &+yrope&n around their base, they have been hung to dry
&nand receive the curing needed before they can be smoked.  The &+gfo&+cl&+gi&+cag&+ge&n has dried
&nbrittle to the touch, the result being a fine residue of cyan-grey powder that
&nseems to coat the parts of the &+gplant&n that haven't been crushed.  The &+cbatch&n has
&na scent reminiscent of mint crossed with a sour citrus.
~
