E
nuggets feral black kush~
&n   This &+mh&+Le&+mr&+Lb&n is comprised of numerous &+mcalyces&n grouped in dense batches along a
&na dark purple stem, the terminating leaves of which are palmate and bear a red
&nhue.  Tiny &+Ltrichomes&n that resemble microscopic black hairs cover much of the
&+Lp&+ml&+La&+mn&+Lt&n's surface, especially on the &+ybracts&n and &+rleaves&n which are covered by the
&nthickest groups of &+mcalyces&n.  Each of these groups can be removed as small,
&ntight &+Lnuggets&n which can then be smoked and inhaled in a number of ways.
~
