cluster wild gootwiet~
&n   Like most wild &+LGo&+go&+Lt&+gwi&+Le&+gt&n, the shoots that have been clustered here are easily
&nrecognizable from their broad, serrate leaves.  Each &+gleaf&n is about eight inches
&nin length and two inches at its widest point, with a green hue that is almost
&nbordering on black.  The &+gle&+La&+gv&+Les&n have been dried and are brittle to the touch,
&neasily breaking down to small flakes when handled.
~
