small ceramic chillum pipe~
&n   This ceramic &+Cch&+ci&+Cl&+clu&+Cm&n is crafted of fired clay.  The whole of its surface has
&nbeen painted white and then covered with images of animals and indecipherable
&+csigils&n in cyan.  The glaze gives a final shine to the &+cch&+Ci&+cl&+Clu&+cm&n and smooths out
&nany rough edges the original piece might have had.  A user places this pipe
&nbetween the pinky and third-finger of their interlocked hands.  As the &+gp&+Gl&+ga&+Gn&+gt
&nmaterial is fired, the user draws the &+Ws&+wm&+Wo&+wk&+We&n into their cupped fists and then
&nthrough their mouths and into their lungs.
~
