shiploader wand~
&+WMake sure you are holding &+LA small wand called 'shiploader'&+W in your
primary hand.&N

&+wExtra Commands:

   - &+WLook Ships (look ship)
   - &+WLook Cargo (look economy)
   - &+WRename Ship <char> <newname> (look rename)
   - &+WTap Crew (look crew)      &+R- DISABLED
   - &+WTap Frag (look frag)      &+R- DISABLED
   - &+WRemove Ship (look remove) &+R- DISABLED
~
E
economy~
 SAMPLE         &+RTharn  &NOasis  Mendon EM     &+RBS  &NSarmiz     Buy
     Tharn      N/A     86     42     103    119    60     145
     Oasis      71     N/A    170      60     60    70     130
     Mendon     98     107    N/A     124    146    146    132
     &+BEM         &+G81      &N60     93     N/A     &+G67    &N113     91
     BS         92     200    109     125    N/A    200     75
     Sarmiz     132    195    140      94     99    N/A     75

     Sailing Cargo from &+RTharn&N to &+GEM &Nwould yeild an 81% Profit
     Sailing Cargo from &+RBS &Nto &+GEM &Nwould yeild a 67% Profit
~
E
crew~
&+WTap crew <&+Rgun&+W/&+Gsail&+W> <crew number> Name
   <crew numbers>
     0 - &+RStandard Crew       &+W/ &+GStandard Crew
     1 - &+RVeteren Archers     &+W/ &+GVeteran Crew
     2 - &+RElite Catapult Crew &+W/ &+GElite Crew
     3 - &+RStamina Crew        &+W/ &+GRepair Crew
     4 - &+RMagical Automotons  &+W/ &+GMagical Automotons

   &+wExample: tap crew gun 4 Raxxel
            &+wtap crew sail 4 Raxxel
    &+RNOTE: DO NOT MESS UP WHEN DOING THIS: CAN CRASH THE MUD&N
~
E
frag~
&+WTap Frag <Number> <Name>
   &+w Number = Tons to be Set
   &+w Name   = Owner of Ship

&+w    Example: tap frag 3000 Raxxel

     &+RNOTE: DO NOT MESS UP WHEN DOING THIS: CAN CRASH THE MUD&N
~
E
remove~
&+WRemove Ship <Owner>&N
&+w      Deletes a ship from the mud&N
&+w   Example: Remove Ship Raxxel
&+l
&+L----------------------------------------------------
~
E
ship~
&+WList Ships&N

&+W  LOOK SHIPS
----------------------
&+w      Lists all ships in the mud&N

&+w        Example
           &+G[GZ]&N: &+MPink Elephant        &+CRaxxel     &+R140331 &+Y61810&N

             &+G[GZ]          &+w- Boat Code, This is what's used to scan or lock
&+w                           a target.

             &+MPink Elephant &+w- Name of ship.

             &+CRaxxel        &+w- Owner of ship

             &+R140331        &+w- Room the ship is currently docked in.

             &+Y 61810        &+w- Room number for the ship's console (bridge of
&+w                           ship)
&+l
&+L----------------------------------------------------
~
E
rename~
&+WLook Rename

&+W Syntax:&+y rename ship &+C<charname> &+M<newshipname>&n

&+W      e.g.  &+y rename ship gellz &+YChicken Ship&n

&+y Will rename Gellz ship from whatever its current name is, to &+YChicken Ship&n
~
