&+Wpower which I may unleash with the ceremony.  I am convinced that she is
&+Wworrying for no reason.  I still haven't told Alec, my only son about the
&+Wexperiments yet.  I fear he is still too young to understand why I do the
&+Wthings I do.  May the Gods forgive my sins, yet I am sure that what I do
&+Wwill be for the benefit of all the humankind.  Tomorrow I will attempt
&+Wthe ceremony, with the help of bishop Gaultair.&N
~
