E
onyx altar~
A massive onyx slab has been transformed into an altar, its surface studded
with jewels. Upon closer inspection, you see that the gems are carefully
arranged to form a mosaic. The picture is that of a woman's arm intertwined
with the writhing body of a serpent. Her blood-red nails are formed with
garnets and rubies, her arm with citrine and moonstone. The serpent seems
alive with the delicate arrangement of emeralds, sapphires, lapis lazuli,
and bloodstone.
~
