E
bed linen bedsheet beds~
Each bed is covered with a green linen bedsheet, far to thin to offer any
protection from the cold. Each is embroidered imperfectly with blood-red
stitches, attempting to form the symbol of their goddess. Once they master
their needlework, a warmer material will be granted to them. Quite a good
incentive the priestesses have placed on their wards.
~
