E
desk desks oaken~
An unlit oil lamp, a quill and inkblot pad, and a small container of ink
stand identically upon each of the four oaken desks. In the center of each
lies a small textbook. It has no title, its blue binding being its only
marking. One would assume that it tells about the teachings of the serpentine
goddess, though, for some reason, you dare not touch it.
~
