rift hole large~
   As you look inside the folds of the rift an image slowly takes form!
The image in the hole shows a small dimly lit chamber with a single table
in it two chairs and a bed.  The walls and ceiling of the room look as
though they are made from lime or some other subterranean rock.  They
are smooth but uneven looking naturally formed.  This place is obviously
very far underground.
~
#12464
rip huge rift~
