+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
:  I've been working on this puzzle since I first found the doors.  I  :
:  had been sent to retrieve something from the stores when I happened :
:  upon them.  Ever since I've been working every spare moment of the  :
:  day to find the secret to them.  I'm positive the runes are the     :
:  key -- the runes and the riddles.  I haven't started to study elven :
:  runes yet so I have no clue as to what the runes mean ... and not   :
:  only that, but I can't even begin to figure out the riddles!        :
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
~
