bottomless bag tinker~
This bag of Tinkers is profoundly the ugliest thing you have ever laid
eyes on.  In hues and colors which just were never meant to be put
together the bag was tactfully designed to assault your sense of
aesthetics.  However, after taking a peek into the bag, you are amazed
to see absolutely no bottom; no wonder the Tinkers can move their
entire lives around in such tiny wagons.  There is a nifty little
strap slung over your shoulder to wear on those long journies across
the land.
~
