E
note script~
The note is written to Guhan, written by Mab, Queen of the Seelie Court.
It reads:

   Leader Guhan,
      I am sorry to inform you that we have not heard of your lost Song.
      I have been informed that you have been searching for as far back as
      the lineage of your people extends, looking for your Song.  My heart
      goes out to you in your endless quest; please take these boots offered
      to you as a most unworthy a gift for such an honorable people.
                   Sincerely,
                      Mab, Queen of Seelie Court
~
