silver pool~
The pool sparkles in the sunlight, clear and clean.  Little fish can be
seen darting along the bottom of the pool.  Nuggets of silver are scattered
along the bottom of the pool and cause the entire pool to radiate reflected
light.  The pool is surrounded by a ring of white stones which creates
a damlike structure to the south where a small stream of water can be
seen pouring over the edge, cascading down the side of the hill.
~
