axe hunting stone hand~
This hand axe has a finely chiseled stone head which is surprisingly
sharp and lethal, while its shaft is made from strong wood bound with
animal hide strips. Additional hide strips and stone rings have been
used in places to balance the axe for throwing. From the painted
markings, it appears many of the barbarians have had these axes
blessed by the local shaman, asking for success in hunting and combat.
~
