#16003
corpse logger~
the corpse of a logger~
&+rThe bloody corpse of a logger has been left here to rot.&N~
~
15 2 3 30 7 0 0 0 0 0 0
100 0 0 100 0 0 0 0
0 0 100
E
logger corpse~
It is clear that whatever killed the logger was incredibly poweful.
His chest has been caved in by a powerful blow and his neck has been
broken.  Oddly enough, although there are no insects in the area now,
bug bites cover the entire corpse, as if it was being devoured by some
horde of ants or other insects.  His bug-bitten face has a frozen
expression of horror, whatever killed him killed him swiftly and
brutally.
~
