obelisk gray stone~
The gray stone is shadowy and has a strange magical sheen to it.  Runes along
its four sides are uninterpretable, it is clearly far older than anything
around it.  In fact, it appears to extend far into the ground, having stood
here so long that the earth has climbed upward to engulf it.  Exactly what it
is, or why it is here is impossible to say, but it is clear that the thorn men
worship it as a god.  The stone itself appears to respond to their odd chants,
humming with an inner life of its own.
~
