E
fountain~
Only dust occupies the bowl of this once beautiful fountain, as well as the
dried husks of plants that used it as a source for water.  The fountain must
once have been quite a display, viewable from all angles with its narrow curls
of marble spiraling up and down its center.  Without water to splash down its
carved arms, the fountain has a dull lifelessness to it that makes it boring
and unattractive.
~
