chest~
Plain in every way except for its lock and the steel bands that reinforce its
lid, this chest is easy to overlook.  As easy as it is to overlook, it is
almost impossible to open.  The owner of this small chest spent all their
money on the complex lock that defies even the most skilled thieves.
~
