key~
On the surface it is just a simple, dull iron key that is easy to overlook. A
close inspection reveals that the teeth of the key are quite delicate and
complex, designed for a lock with a large number of delicate tumblers.  Most
keys and locks of such complexity have an open ornateness to them that
distinguishes them from the more plain varieties.  This key has a simple, but
effective, design, that didn't cost a mint to create.
~
