hue.  This armor is clearly quite magical, and valuable.  It must have taken
several craftsmen a great deal of time to complete this fine piece.  Small
scales of jodani wood have been carefully placed together to create a piece
of armor that has no gaps and is extremely protective, yet is also quite
supple and easy to move around in.  Only the most powerful warriors could hope
to keep such an item for long.
