E
pool ruby~
The pool is about one hundred feet in diameter and is filled with a dark red
liquid that reflects light and throws  it around.  White marble bricks enclose
the pool cut to fit  perfectly together.  The pool swirls into a picture!
You see the blurred images of a smoke filled cavern who's walls are
made of red flowing rock resembling molten lava with bits of bone
and sharp rocks mixed in.  The room seems intensely hot and the only
detail that can be discerned through the smoke is a huge carving of
a multi-colored five-headed dragon on the floor.  This carving is
definitely not a hydra.
~
