nest~
&n   This &+ynest&n has been made from a pile of fallen &+yleaves&n by a family
of &+gtree&+Lclimbers&n.  This location probably has been chosen for its natural
protection from the stone walls, and its concealed nature.  It does seem strange
that a species of animal which spends its life climbing the huge &+gtrees&n of
&+gAravne&n should make its nest on the &+gforest&n floor.
~
