   One of the most fabled and powerful weapons found in the lands of Duris, the
great &+YSunlash&n was lost for many millenia, after the horrid outcome of the
outcast wars. Little beknownst to the inhabitants of the world, it had been
usurped by the malevolent Strahd Von Zarovich, thinking that it was the
legendary &+YSun&+WSword&n, and locked away for all time. This eventually came
to the attention of the great &+WBahamut&n, and, infuriated, he sent the mighty
&+YLareth&n to reclaim the mighty weapon. A terrible battle for the whip
ensued in the realm of Ravenloft, and in the midst of the horrific struggle
between the forces of good and evil, a Vistani agent stole the whip...
~
