orb unmaking~
&+LThe Orb of Unmaking is by far the most powerful artifact of The Negative
&+LMaterial Plane.  The Orb has has been wielded by some of the most dangerous
&+Land imfamous gods and mortals in the history of Duris; Nakyrul,
&+LDranum, and Cython (as well as several others in the distant past)
&+Lhave wielded the power of The Orb.  Capable of snuffing out life, like a mortal
&+Lmight snuff out a candle, The Orb leaves The Negative Material Plane in the
&+Lhands of some unwitting mortal, and leaves a wake of destruction behind.

&+LIt is said that The Orb actually contains the soul and power of the first
&+Lvampire; others have said that The Orb contains an ancient race indegenous to
&+LThe Negative Material Plane, that was trapped inside The Orb as a punishment
&+Lfrom the Greater Gods of the Astral Plane for unspeakable crimes...

&+LEither way, The Orb is one of the most powerful, evil and generaly ugly
&+LArtifacts of Power to ever exist.  The wielder becomes nearly a god, having
&+La great assortment of defensive, offensive and miscellaneous powers.
~
