vial venom adder~
The undead adder has the deadliest venom ever known througout time.
It essentially makes cobra venom seem like fruit juice, black death taste
like some condiment youd spread on your toast, and tiamats poison be equivelent
to spicy pepper juice.  The touch of undead adder venom always paralyzes the
victim, for as long as a full hour from the slightest touch.  Fortunately it
is extremely scarce, and mortal assassins have only gotten their hands on the
wicked stuff 2 or 3 times in all history.
And luckily for you, this appears to be a magical vial containing
a nearly unlimited amount of poison.
~
