boots stealth~
Similar in effect to boots of elvenkind, boots of stealth are an extremely
rare item, occasionaly sold by Arcanes and other trans-planar merchants.
The boots work differently than boots of elvenkind however.  Boots of elvenkind
magically do not make sound, while boots of stealth give the user some general
heightened dexterity, along with a keen understand of stealth.

It is said that this type of boot are particularly valued by the more adept
members of the Order of Dire Stalkers.  Also, boots of stealth are valued by
many because due to their other unique enchantment -- one size fits all.
~
