   Tsunami, trident of storms is a three-pronged spear carved out of
a single piece of coral. The three spear-tips have each been carved in
in the shape of sea horses with their tails joined together at the base.
Intricate symbols run down the length of the shaft hinting mysterious
powers bound to the item by Poseidon, king of the sea. Stories fortell of
great storms and giant waves caused by the gods terrible rage as he thrusts
the trident into the ocean floor or raises it to summon hurricane winds.
