mace godsfury~
Forged long ago by the ancient dwarven gods, this mace has a history that
has been told to generations of mountain dwarves, passed on from father to
son in an endless chain.  This mace was lost long ago by the dwarven king
Khal-alhak, ambushed in the mountain passes near Kimordril by hobgoblins
of the Bloodfang Clan.  A long war erupted between the dwarves and the
hobgolins, with untold atrocities being committed by both sides.
Centuries later, it was recovered by Khal-alhak's grandson when the
dwarves leveled the last fortress of the Bloodfang Clan.  Thirty years
ago, the mace and its guardian, the priest Tholgrom, disappeared without a
trace.
~
