great fountain arachdrathos~
This fountain is absoluetley beautiful, made of softly marbled basalt it has
been shaped in the drow image of the spider demoness. She holds a great web
in her hands with a stone arch near the middel surrounded by five other rock
spires near the edge of the web. Water trickles along the basalt to drip from
the middle of the web to fall into a large pool at her feet.
~
