of the Tol-Kendar, or body wrecker, is about eight feet long, with a barbed
fluted and cross shaped blade on the tip. Each face of the barbed tip is
about the same size as a glaive. The danger with the tol-kendar is not the
damage it inflicts on the way in. It is the disembolwing it can render its
victim on the way out.
