   &+L|&n   One shall brave the dragons, and shall seek out the source of  &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  their power.  Upon discovering their power, the said, will then &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  seek its demise.  To unlock the path to the dragons, one must   &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  best the guardians of this plaque.  From these guardians one    &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  will retrieve an item and return it to the castle lord.  The    &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  castle lord upon recieving the said item, will enable you to    &+L|&n
   &+L|&n  unlock the way to victory.                                      &+L|&n
   &+L|&n                                                                  &+L|&n
