diary entry parchment paper~
+-------------------------------------------------+
|                                                 |
|   Ah Thalos, Thalos!  Once so beautiful, even   |
|   envied by the gods!  But now it is no more,   |
|   cast down for its pride.                      |
|                                                 |
|   We fled the city, but I can feel *them*       |
|   following after us, tracking us like a wolf.  |
|   But no wolf was ever this deadly.             |
|                                                 |
|   Behind us is horror, and the city before us   |
|   has an evil reputation.  It is said that      |
|   Nizari's Sultan has made pacts with Evil --   |
|   But more on that later.  I an hear them       |
|   coming.  No!  They are here!  They are he     |
|                                                 |
\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/
~
