massive adamantite statue~
   This monstrous statue depicts a massive Githzerai &+Ldeath knight&N
standing in a battle pose, his sword raised up high.  A strange sensation
of &+Lfear &Nand &+Lmeakness &Nsweeps over you just from gazing at this figure.
Either the master craftsman who chiseled this statue exaggerated the
size greatly, or this particular Githzerai warlord was much taller and
stronger then normal.  Huge muscles buldge out through his platemail and
beneath his robes.  A large battle helmet rests above his brow
   Even through the stone and metal of the statue, a piercing &+rflame&N can
be seen emanating from his &+Wgh&No&+Ws&Nt&+Wly&N &+Wstare.
~
E
ghostly stare~
&+LNauseau, &+rpain, &+Land a sense of &+bvulnerability&+L sweep over anyone
&+Lwho looks into this statue's glowing stare.
   &+LBrutal &+cimages&+L of &+rdomination&+L and &+rdestruction&+L plague your
&+Lmind as you witness a spectacular display of Raylen Xarvyn, lord of
&+Lthe githzerai death knighthood, slaughtering his opposition with
&+Lan unspeakable rage and strength.

   &+L...Within moments, the &+cimages&+L seem to fade, as this is just a
&+Lstatue of the great death knight...
~
