massive adamantite statue~
   This massive &+Ladamantite&N statue is of a frighteningly vicious-
looking githzerai warrior.  The statue is about eight feet tall,
which is much taller then the average githzerai.  This warrior
does not wear anywhere near as much armor as the others, but,
however, appears to be twice as strong with rippled &+mveins&N and
bulging muscles covering his body.  The craftsman who captured
this frenzied githzerai warrior in this pose truely is a master
artisan.  Various droplets of &+Rblood &Non the warrior's hands, face,
and arms are depicted as tiny &+rbloodstones&N, perfectly sized and
placed into position.
   Although still set in statue, a ruthless and frenzied &+Wstare&N of
total BloodLust hazes over its eyes.
~
E
stare bloodlust~
&+RAnger, &+rfury, and a sense of BloodLust &+Lseem to fill the instincts of anyone
&+Lwho gazes into this fearsome figure's &+Wstare&+L.
   &+LGhostly &+cimages&+L suddenly violate your mind, as unspeakable acts
&+Lof this githzerai blood warrior unfold.  Centuries of battles, pillaging
&+Land slaughters are all visable within a single gaze into this statue's
&+Lstare.  The great githzerai blood warrior, Kraange Xarvyn, stands with
&+Lhis tribe of blood warriors, laying brutal siege across the land.
&+LAn almost unstoppable urge to cower and beg for one's life emcompasses
&+Lyou.
   &+L...The &+cimages&+L subside, however, as this is just a statue...
~
