This scroll is marvelously crafted and seems in prestine condition. It is
made of a thick parchment and is bound with a thick ribbon of velvet. The
text is written in an ancient dialect, making it difficult to understand.
However, you can clearly understand the large friendly letters written at
the top of the scroll.

               "Recite me and I will reveal my secrets."
