table gambling rules~
&+yAs you stare, the &+bm&+Ba&+Cg&+Wi&+Cc&+Ba&+bl &+bf&+Bl&+Cam&+Be&+bs&+y on top of the table coalesce into some &+Rrules&+y written in a language so that you can understand them.
&+yThe &+RRULES&+y clearly state:
&+M * &+yThe &+CDealer&+y is always right!
&+M * &+yAt any stage, you can ask to &+WSHOWGAME&+y and find out the current status
&+M * &+yYou must place an &+WOFFER&+y of some coins in order to play. Use "offer 10 plat" or "offer 2 g" for example
&+M * &+yYou can &+WDEAL&+y only once you have a valid &+WOFFER&+y in place
&+M * &+yYou can &+WSTAY&+y, &+WFOLD&+y, or &+WHIT&+y only after a &+WDEAL
&+M * &+yIf you &+WFOLD&+y, you will loose whatever bet you have on the table currently
&+M * &+yThere are &+rNO&+y Aces in this deck, only ones!
&+M * &+yYou may &+rNOT&+y split pairs
&+M * &+yYou cannot &+rdouble-down&+y
&+M * &+yReport any issues or errors to an &+rImmortal&+y&n
~
