E
golden yuan ti relic~
   &+YThis golden relic is of a powerful two-headed yuan-ti wizard, most
&+Ylikely a powerful shadowmage diety like Juggashk the avatar of venom,
&+Yan 'inspiration' for Strahd over the years.  The yuan-ti and ophidians
&+Yhave become a certain fascination for the vampire count.  It is under-
&+Ystandable, furthermore, as the relationship between the yuan-ti and the
&+Yophidians is quite similar to Strahd and his Vistani's relationship with
&+Ythe people of Barovia and those that enter its forests.
   &+YThis miniature statue sits here, sealed to the floor, almost as if it
&+Ywas part of the darkstone itself.  It doesn't appear to be going anywhere
&+Yas it is controlled by a powerful magic, but does appear to be quite shiny,
&+Ymuch like the ophidian statue.  Someone has definitely given this statue
&+Ya good rubbing.
~
#58306
golden ophidian relic idol~
&+Ya golden ophidian idol&N~
&+YA golden ophidian relic sits upright on the floor.~
~
29 24 3 0 7 0 4096 0 64 0 0
259 58446 5 0 0 0 0 0
0 0 100
E
golden ophidian relic~
   &+YThis flawlessly crafted of a large, hunched over, bipedal ophidian
&+Yis perfect.  The ophidian is a race known notoriously as an enslaved
&+Yrace, bred and controlled by the yuan-ti.  The relationship between
&+Ythese two races, the yuan-ti and the enslaved ophidians is similar to
&+Ythe relationship between Strahd and the Barovians, only most of the
&+YBarovians don't realize it.
   &+YThis golden relic sits upright upon the ground, unable to move from
&+Yits connection to the treasury's floor.  Sealed down on the ground, it
&+Ydoes appear very shiny, perhaps after its been given a good rubbing.
&+YEither way, this thing won't budge.
~
