ancient cracked altar~
   &+WThis huge limestone and marble-topped altar rests at the center of the
&+Wstepped dais, the focul point of the great Ravenloft Chapel.  It is at this
&+Wvery altar in which Tatyana and Strahd were to be married, or as it is
&+Win Strahd's mind.  A dark howl penetrates the thick, dark haze in this dismal
&+Wcastle; its chilling kiss has given the altar a cold, lifeless touch.
   &+LA huge crack runs along the entire altar, almost splitting it into two
&+Lperfect halves right down the middle.  A closer inspection reveals that the
&+Lthis altar was broken in one solid blow, perhaps from a great magical force,
&+Lrather then from any type of detonation or masonry.
~
