&+Wchain and travelling garb bearing the old crest of the &+rBloodstone Barony&+W.
&+WPerhaps a Vistani in disguise, or an actual rogue who had once penetrated this
&+Wdepth of the Castle, nevertheless the fate of this corpse was at this altar,
&+Wmany, many years ago.
   &+RThe arm of these skeletal remains is frozen in place, reaching upward to
&+Rthe very top of the altar, whereupon the &+Ccrystal idol, the Icon of Ravenloft,
&+Ra beautifully-crafted statue of a raven made of the purest, yet malevolent
&+Rcrystal.
   &+LThis cadaver seems to have escaped whatever foul corruption plaguing this
&+Lcastle that has brought forth such other foul undead beasts.
