&+Wwielded by the &+RHierarch &+rKuluk'shokourung'tagag'onk&+W, the &+Caxe&+W is
&+Wfamous for being virtually impossible to wield, pronounce, or even be around
&+Wwithout encountering some form of injury.  For centuries, it was at the forefront
&+Wof all famous military loses in the realm.  It wasn't until the &+CElemenstor General
&+Wdevised a cunning plan to give the &+YShokurung'otaghe'rakag'onk'rakag &+Wto the
&+Wopposing army that it was actually used effectively.

&+WThe &+YShokurung'otaghe'rakag'onk'rakag &+Wis held in great esteem by the &+rZarovich
&+Wfamily.  Legend has it that if any man could wield the mighty axe he would become
&+Wa god.  No man has succeeded at the task until &+rStrahd Von Zarovich&+W grasped
&+Wthe blade, tossing it right back into the hands of the &+RHierarch &+rKuluk'shoko-
&+rurung'tagag'onk&+W and then &+rripping&+W out his &+Rheart &+Wbefore his own son,
