bone throne slime~
   &+LThis massive &+Wbone &+Lthrone took dozens of different tanar'ri's corpses
&+Lto make.  Huge wings overlap smaller wings with strange barbed claws at the
&+Lpeak of this throne.  The top being mostly dry from the huge pool of acrid
&+Lslime that occupies the lower floor of this rocky cave, deep within Zionyn.
&+LThe bottom of the throne has two huge skulls on either side of the arms, which
&+Lare made of stalks of vertebrae bunched together.  Various massive tanar'ri
&+Lribcages bound together make up the back and seat of the throne, while hundreds
&+Lof other random bones sit interlocked between these ribcages.  This throne sits
&+Ldeep within the pool of slime, so that Obox-Ob may bask in his slime pool while
&+Lsitting atop his throne.  This throne, although massive, blocks sight of the
&+Llower, deepest part of the slime pool, however.
~
