journal~
   &+yThe journal is blank and water-damaged, except for the last page:

     &+y"He tells me what a good wife I'd be.  If only... if only his heart
   &+ywas not pledged to another. My own heart, already still, turned black
   &+ythat day. he has brought me here, into this silent grave. My passion
   &+yhas blossomed to hate. I'd destroy him if I could, yet his power over
   &+yme is uncontestable. He lets me suffer this way when he could simply
   &+ycommand me to love him. How I hate him.

     &+yIf you are reading this, I am destroyed. You can destroy Strahd if
   &+yyou are strong. Find the Dayheart and destroy it. Perhaps you'll also
   &+yfind the Sunsword, Strahd's bane. Unprotected by the Dayheart, his
   &+yflesh is vulnerable to the light I forswore for him, in vain."
~
