E
statue onyx~
This exceptionally crafted statue is hewn from deep black onyx.
The intricacies and quality of the statue are amazing. This is the work
of one of the most skilled craftsmen on Duris. The figure is that of a
small and wiry dwarf. Dressed in leather armor, a hood covers most of
the head leaving the eyes exposed. The dwarf carries an elegant dagger
in one hand while the other hand remains hidden, as if concealing a dart
or other projectile. This dwarf is a rogue of the highest caliber. A
few words are written on a plaque in elegant roman font:

-Kharne, god of Thieves
~
