unique vapor green haze swirling~
&+LYou gaze at the green vapor swirling before your eyes.  Ever twisting
&+Land turning, your thoughts turn to a pit of hissing snakes.  Several
&+Ltentacles of solid vapor sprung from the cloud seem to probe their
&+Lsurroundings as if searching for something.  As a tentacle comes
&+Lwrithing in your direction, every fiber of your body screams for you to
&+Lflee, but alas, it is too late.  With lightning speed the tentacle
&+Llashes out, wraps itself around your chest.  You scream in pain and
&+Lterror as a chilling cold spreads throughout your body, numbing you to
&+Lthe core.  You cannot help but to stare into the center of the cloud,
&+Lwondering if it's not somehow alive.  As your thoughts flicker and die,
&+Lthe last thing that accompanies you on your way into oblivion is the
&+Lsound of cold laughter ringing in your ears...&n
~
