statuette floating~
The statuette floats gracefully, an aura surrounding it that does not allow
anything but the glance of the eye. The image is of a woman's hands, a
glowing ball cupped delicately in them. It seems as though it is almost
beckoning that the orb be taken from it. Coarse blue sleeves fall away from
the hands, and that is where the image ends. Though one can walk completely
around it, the image remains always the same as if there were no other
dimension to it than the one visible.
~
