On the hilt of the sword is an ornately carved handle that hums
continuously. The edge of the blade is covered with carved runes
that glow. When you hold the blade, you feel strange-- as though
you have more of an understanding of the world around you and the
people in it. You suddenly understand the runes; they speak of 3
elves, Mortyle, Florn, and Shem, all whom which forged this blade
from the fires of a prehistoric volcano. Each elf had a unique
gift of tracking and hunting, and each carved their symbol into
the sword.
