portal~
The portal shimmers as its bluish-black texture ripples like a body
of water.  Concentric circles of blue electricity pulse from the
perimeter, towards the center, becoming smaller as they progress.
Around the portal is a gold leaf ring.  The ring is scribed with
a language foriegn to your eyes.  Also noticiable are many miniature
demons crafted of pure gold.  The eyes of these creatures seem to
oscillate between purple and red.  The portal is suspended by
nothing that can be seen.
~
