E
book~
The squirrels in and around the Keep of Bloodstone are abundant.
They eat almost anything, and are always eager for handouts.
The squirrels health usually ranges between &+W45&n to &+W54.
Squirrels have a combinations of features which make them good pets.
The fur is somewhat thick, and their agility is superb.  This makes
it difficult for other animals to kill them easily.  Squirrels
from the Shargaas Pet shop in Bloodstone, have been tested under
preditory conditions.  They have a Shargaas defensive rating of
&+W30&N.  The squirrel, though not a vicious animal, does make
