E
book~
The black wolf of the Svalich woods makes an excellent companion.
The wolf is capable of protecting its master with some degree of
success.  The wolf has a Shargaas offensive rating of &+W14&N and
its fangs can rip into an opponent with &+W8&N to &+W17&N points of
damage.  The wolves sold in the Bloodstone Keep have been conditioned
and trained for endurance.  They have a health range of &+W107&N to
&+W142&N.  These strong creatures are feared thoughout the realms
but are not invunerable.  They have a Shargaas defensive rating of
&+W10&N making them somewhat easy to hit.  The shopkeepers have
done you the favor of training the wolf to hate good races.
Overall, the black wolf is an excellent pet to purchase.
~
