0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
3 630 100
E
book~
The Svalich bear is one of the most powerful creatures in the
woods.  The average bear stands some 7 feet tall and weighs in
at a hefty 690 pounds.  The bears sold in Bloodstone have
been trained to defend their masters to the death.  They are
quite capable of shredding most any threat.  Their powerful claws
can do damages ranging from &+W9&N to &+W24&N points.  The pet
keepers at Shargaas Pets in Bloodstone take excellent care of these
creatures so that they grow to be healty and strong.  Their health
is guaranteed to meet a minimum of &+W150&N points.  Through
experience we have learned that the bear has a Shargaas offensive
rating of &+W10&N and a defensive score of &+W0&N.  For the
adventurer that travels into the dangerous Svalich woods, this pet
is an excellent companion.
~
