E
book~
Stirge can be found in most parts of the Svalich woods.  Though
plentiful, not too much information is available.  Their health
range varies and is quite irratic.  However, through many
experiments, the stirge has been found to be very capable
of causing significant damage.  Their long beaks are able to pierce
with an average damage of &+W10&N points.  Tests are still being
performed to determine how the stirge fairs in combat, but this
information was not made available at the time of publishing.
Initial tests reveal that the stirge seems to be a deadly companion.
~
