E
statue~
This is a statue that is hewn from the most jet-black marble in the realms,
flawless in quality and dazzling in intricacy.  The figure is a uncanny
likeness of a short, and extremely stocky human.  Clad in field plate,
begrimed with gore, a crested great helm lies beneath this man's foot,
exposing the head to the elements.  Matted hair, rivulets of sweat,
spattered blood, a maniacal grin, and a long, wickedly notched sword in
his left hand displays his ever-present lust for combat.  A few words
are carved at the base of the statue that read:

'Haemos Sanguine -
 Knight of Unholy Might, Bringer of Havoc, Minion Of the Maiden Loviatar'
~
