small iron bound iron-bound chest~
This small chest has bands of iron on it.  It looks quite sturdy, as the wood
is still tough and the iron shows no signs of rusting.  It also has a very
sturdy looking lock that has obviously been crafted with great
percision by the looks of it.
~
