elven green chainmail chain mail full suit~
This chainmail suit is of the highest quality, and it is no doubt that Lord
Ghulan had to fight to get it. The craftsmanship is utterly flawless, with
the links being identical and perfectly spaced.  Furthermore, the individual
links have been wrapped in silk causing the chainmail to make little noise
when the wearer moves. The armor alows excellent movement, leaving the user
almost virtually unhindered.
~
