A strange object, similar to a dagger, has been left here.~
~
5 16 3 3 7 0 0 8193 0 4198895524 0
2 3 3 11 0 0 0 0
2 10000 100
E
madhu dagger~
The madhu is a bizzare weapon.  Consisting of a buckler shield sized basket
guard with a 4 inch spike sticking out , with a 6 inch blade jutting out
the "bottom" and an 18 inch blade jutting out the top, it makes for a weapon
that is extremely effective for defense, and extremely annoying to fight
against, as attacks made with it are bizzare when compared to typical sword
and dagger attacks. Unfortunately, due to its unusual nature, it is difficult
to strike powerfully, and even though it is easy to land a hit with it,
the blows are not especially damaging.
~
