granite stone~
The stone has an inexplicable magic to it, one that can't easily be explained
or understood.  None of the jungle plants have attempted to overgrow it.
Someone has carved a graceful scene into the stone with a skill that even
the finest craftsman would be hard-pressed to match.
~
E
carving scene picture~
The carving depicts a massive crystalline dragon resting upon a cloud of some
sort.  The intricate world that has been carved around the dragon doesn't
appear to match anything in the vast world of Duris.  It must be a depiction
of some other plane, or other world, perhaps of the artist's imagination.  In
the dragon's hands is a large, twisted staff with a crystal of some sort at its
head.
~
