piece note parchment~
The note reads,
        &+rMagistrate&n, dear friend &+MMar&+rkam&n. I have kept this
note for a year now waiting for some sign of Mavericks re-appearance.
If you recieve this then I have found that sign.  I warn you now the
city is in danger, if Maverick has found a new body, he will stop at
nothing to purge us.  He still may have possession of the &+YSoul&+WSword.
We must find who he has working for him and remove them. I must
be off now, to search the world for him, take care of this city,
god bless.
                                You friend, &+WRol&+Land
~
