old tome entitled advanced magic missile techniques book spellbook~
  &+yThis humorously-named spellbook is written entirely in &+Rgnomish&n&+y and
&+yis authored by an Ashrumite-blooded &+RDweefniggle&N&+y, one name only.
&+yThis aged tome is a collection of boisterously-phrased casting techniques
&+yand their associated gestures in a series of chapters complete with drawings
&+yand magic keywords involved in their casting.  Although common knowledge to
&+yany &+Mmage&n&+y, this tome was originally intended to portray means of
&+ygetting extra &+Wpower &N&+Yor &+Crange &n&+yon &+Ymagic missile &N&+yattacks.
   &N&+yAlthough none of the cartoonish imagery or hair-brained practices have
&+yever faired to actually work, this &N&+mtome &+yis still heavily sought
&+yafter by collectors, as only a few were made, each hand-written by the
&+ybook's author &+RDweefniggle&N&+y.
~
