altar llyms llym llyms_altar wondrous~
   Llym's wondrous altar is an ancient artifact, created centuries ago by the
legendary archmage Llym, the mysterious benefactor of the Brotherhood
of the Purple Hood in faroff Halruaa.  The altar is carved from a mystic blue
metal and inlaid with many runes and glyphs.  Its surface is veined
with coppery highlights.  The altar squats on three short legs, and
has a large, gaping mouth fashioned at its top.  Nigh-unbreakable magic
binds it in place.
~
