fountain emerald blood-filled huge~
This fountain is about four feet in diameter, its basin supported by a
two foot tall pillar of solid emerald. Deep runes are carved into the
sides of the fountain, covered with dropplets of blood which cascade over
the side of the object as the fountain spurts the scarlet liquid forth.
From the fountain edge, the rivulets of blood can be seen to flow slowly
to the east.
~
