The basin and pedestal of this fountain are carved from solid garnet, a
thing of unimaginable beauty and value. Deep runes cover the entire
surface of the four foot diamater fountain and its basin is filled with
the recognizable smell of seawater. Sprays of the water stream out over
the basin to spill upon the floor, where they quickly form into a glowing
pool.
