page3~

	&+LStrahd does not have control!  I am in control!
	&+LThese are my people.  MY THOUGHTS! Must fight evil---
	&+LFight evil...fight Strahd.. Kill evil and Kill Strahd---

	&+LDoru died.  Strahd took Doru from me I KNOW IT WAS HIM!
	&+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge.
	&+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge.
	&+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge. &+LRevenge.
	&+LREVENGE!!!!!!  KILL STRAHD AND KILL ALL EVIL!!!!!
	
	&+LI have found the answer.  Liber Blaspheme.  I found the
	&+LLiber Blaspheme years ago in Castle Ravenloft.  Strahd
	&+Lhid it because he know it would kill him and his horrible
	&+Lrule will be over.  Yes I will use the Liber Blaspheme to
	&+Lkill Strahd and ward us of evil.. No ... Not just kill Strahd
	&+Lbut torture his soul for years.  Doru will help me.  Liber
	&+LBlaspheme will help him rise again.  Doru and I will have
	&+Lour revenge on Strahd and evil will be slaughtered.

	&+LLiber Blaspheme will bring Doru back.

&+WThe rest of the ramblings are all focused around the words 'Revenge'
&+Wand 'Kill.'  Hardly the type of literature one would expect in a holy
&+Wbible by the village priest.
~
