page2~
	&+LIreena Kolyana is not the natural daughter of Kolyan Indirovich.
	&+LIreena never knew, but old Kolyan found her one day at the edge
	&+Lof the Svalich Woods near the very foot of Ravenloft's crag.
	&+LShe was but a girl then and had no memory of her past.  Kolyan
	&+Ladopted her as though she were his own and loved her dearly.

        &+LSee page3
~
