page1~
	&+LThere is a book, the Tome of Strahd, that might shed light
	&+Lon the steps necessary to destroy the monster of the castle.
	&+LIt is well known that Strahd kept meticulous notes from
	&+Lancient times on all he did or said.  Perhaps some weakness
	&+Lof his could be found there.  This tome was once located in
	&+LRavenloft's library, but now I'm not sure where it is.  I
	&+Lasked Madam Eva about it, and she mumbled something
	&+Lindecipherable.  Why do seers always speak in riddles?"

	&+LSee page2
~
