only in elven royalty, and the folds wash away like waves on the sword
coast. It feels like a warm soft cloud, completely engulfing and sinfully
wonderful.  It is forged from the winds that blow across the Ethereal
Plains, the reserve of power every magi draws his craft from.  It's
hardly visible, just a slight disturbance in the corner of one's eye.
~
A
