E
horse corpse~
   The horses front leg has a visible compound fracture above the right hoof.
It is easy to understand how this could have happened on the trail around the
ice flow, considering all th rocks.  The blow to the neck appears to have two
ends, it doesn't go all the way across the neck like a sword slash.  It is
also much deeper than a sword would ever go, it looks much like an axe wound.
The corpse has not decayed yet so it can only be a day or so old, but in
these frigid temperatures there can be no telling for sure.
~
