5 3 5 3 0 0 0 0
1 10 100
E
wakizashi sword~
   Unlike most swords, the metal of the blade does not extend to the end
of the pommel.  Halfway down the shaft of the handle, the blade stops and
is held in place by a plug that passes thru the blade and the two halves
of the grip.  The plug is in turn held in place by the black cloth wrap
that twists around the handle, providing not only structural support, but
a comfortable grip as well.  The metal of the blade is honed to a razor
edge, with the waves of the temper fully visible as a result of the clay
quenching process.  It is a most fearsome weapon in close quarters.
~
