&+LMahdrel,

   Myrke has discovered an effort to reclaim the shroud.  It must be
foiled at all costs.  The craftsmen rebuilding the upper hallways have
redesigned the rooms surrounding the vault. Your key will be the first in
a group of several that will be required to access the shroud.  For
maximum security I have spread them out among trusted men.  You are to
slay on sight any that enters your post without me at their side,
including any of our own that wander in...trust no one.  The shroud is
vital to our efforts, I trust you will not fail me.

