wrist pouch~
   An ingenious little device that utilizes some sort of temporal magic
to allow the storage of a few small items within the tiny pouch.  The
pouch is designed to wrap around ones wrist and clasp on, serving as
protection.  Thin bands of steel are inserted in between the layers of
leather, the purpose being to provide support, strength, and protection
from the cutting edge of a sword should it ever come in contact with one.
The opening is protected by a key lock, sewn into the cover flap.
~
