The top and bottom parts of this note have been torn off. The remainder reads:

....forbade him to continue, and exiled him. Upon recieving this doom he swore
vengance against the council, and upon all the living. He was sure that someday
he would unlock the secrets of the undead and would use them against us. After
months had passed nothing further was thought of him, until that day they came
from the well. He had continued his research right under our noses, and the
time for vengance had come. However he had gone too far in his studies, turning
himself into something not of this world. Rather than simply slaughtering his
foes, he took them back to perform some sort of experiment on them,
re-animating their bodies and using them to continue his fight. I believe he
was seeking a way to return to his human form, but his power..........
~
