blood onyx tub~
   Constructed of pure onyx, this tub would make a lavish addition to
any household. However, this tub in particular is stained very deeply
with blood, gore and death. Its clawed feet resemble that of a specie
of demon. A pool of bubbling blood froths just under the brim of this
masterfully designed onyx tub. The blood looks so refreshing, perhaps
one should try &+rbathing&n in it.
~
