&+Lgrey tiger-stripe patterns.  Their bulbous orange eyes emerge on each side&N
&+Lof a long flat snout, the underside of which is best suited to scraping&N
&+Lalgae off the smooth &+Wivory &+Lof the &+Bfountain&+L.  A long dorsal fin spans the&N
