&+Lmen stand in mortal combat, weapons locked and bodies entwined.  Each of the&N
&+Lmen wears a crown upon his head, and royal insignias garnish their tunics.&N
&+LThis is the battle of Ergan Dale, the last great battle between the men of&N
&+WTharnadia &+Land their northern &+Bbarbarian &+Lcousins.&N
