onyx plaque~
&+L .  .. ___________________                             __________________ .. .
&+L                          \___________________________/
&+L
&+L                 ____________  Welcome to Tharnadia  ____________
&+L                             \______________________/
&+L
&+L                  Greetings, and welcome to our fair city.  A
&+L                  few words, If we may, to those of you who are
&+L                  new to Tharnadia.  We welcome you to visit the
&+L                  merchant sector in the northwest of the city,
&+L                  where you will find most of our fine shops and
&+L                  our modern court system.  To the east you may
&+L                  want to check out the Great Bazaar, where those
&+L                  merchants from the surrounding providences,
&+L                  hawk their goods.  Surrounding the twin keeps
&+L                  you can find our docks and our park.  These
&+L                  places are both exquisite and we urge you to
&+L                  check them out.  A warning though, although
&+L                  we take great pains to keep vandalism and crime
&+L                  at bay, like any city, we have our trouble
&+L                  areas.  The southwest portion of town is one
&+L                  such place.  Pease, for your own safety, steer
&+L                  clear of that area.  If you do wander there, it
&+L                  is at your own risk.
&+L
&+L                                    The Elders
&+L   . .. _____________________________________________________________ .. .
&+L               .. . ______                           _____ . ..
&+L                          \_________________________/
~
