small wolf pup black fur furry~
This incredibly tiny wolf pup is curled up and resting peacefully, and even when picked up isn't disturbed from his slumber.  It is no wonder that he was able to escape his master's room so easily, he could almost be confused for a rabbit because of his small size.  There is little doubt that he will one day grow into a large and powerful hunter however.
