T - Tharnadia - Fun times in the big city!

W - Woodseer - Smaller than Tharnadia but the halflings are a lot of fun!  A lot of small strange creatures in the Jungle outside make some nice practice though, especially the elusive bullywugs if you can find them!

O - Twin Towers - A nice scenic get-a-way from city life.  Filled with small and friendly woodland creatures.

A - Ako - A woodland teaming with small woodland wildlife surrounding a sleepy little village.  Great place to visit in your early adventures!

V - Vella's Bordello - Now who couldn't find some fun here?!  Tip some of the women here a few gold coins and they will follow you anywhere!

Z - Turopolis - Use to be a great place to visit, but falling apart lately and inhabitted by slimes and other strange creatures.  The zoo in the northeast corner is still working though, and is DEFINATELY worth visiting.

B - Bridge - The river is very wide at this point, meaning this is the only available place to cross.  This large bridge spans east/west with horse stables lying through gates to the north and south along the way to speed travel.  Beware the kobolds that lie in wait of unwary adventurers!

D - The Tharnadian Docks - Once you save up some spare cash you can build the ship of your dreams and sail to distant lands.. or build a warship and sink other people doing that!
~
