E
farmer impailed figure&n~
   The farmer looks fairly recently impailed. He seems to have been in his
mid-thirites and looks to have been dead for about a day or so. His throat has
been cut and he has been impailed on a black steel pike that is rusted.
Nailed to his chest with a iron spike is a large note written on parchment
paper that looks like it has been taken out of a book. The note has been
written in fresh &n&+rblood &nand reads:


&+r              I told ye people to
&+r            leave me be and I would
&+r            only kill a hand full of
&+r            ye. Should ye persist in
&+r            your efforts to attack
&+r            me I will destroy your
&+r            village utterly ye stupid
&+r            inbred dogs.

&+r                    Your Master
&+r                    Urian Shadowborn
&n
~
