letter finely&n~


   I hope that this letter reaches you in good health my friend. The work
to raise our master from the dark pits where he is imprisioned is going well.
After penning this letter I go to make the proper sacrifices and then to
go attempt to open his prision. You may go ahead and start your offensive
against Tharnadia, I will join you when I am done here. With the might of
Sargon again on our side and their god all but forgotten, we shall surely
crush all those sent against us. Also, remember that you agreed to march on
Ghore with me. The betrayl the trolls of ghore fave us shall be revisited
apon them ten fold when we destroy their city.

&+L                                         Urian Shadowborn
&n
~
