E
sargon unholy book&n~
&+L   This unholy book seems to detail not only the retiruals in observation of
&+Lthe ancient god, but also his history. Flipping through the book you come to
&+La page that was marked by a red verlvet book marker. This page seems to have
&+Lbeen read over and over again. It reads...


   &+L  ...then the five piece of the great star shall be brought back
   &+L   together. And once they are they will release our God from his
&+L      imprisonment in the ring of stones. Know that on this day you must
&+L      sacrifice five virgin women, and bring the leader of the five
&+L      sections together, each shall bring their piece of the great star.
&+L         The time for this will be when the God of Light is at her
&+L      weakest. Know that when she has her last cleric in the city of
&+L      the ring of stones, that you must bring him there, and though
&+L      his sacrice on the stone the star shall be brought together. Only
&+L      he can put the star together, through his blood, or through his
&+L      knowledge.&n
~
