E
letter bloodstone&n~
&+L   Dear Kinslor,


&+L   My old friend it is good to hear from you. I had heard that you were
&+Lworking toward the raising of your ancient god. From what I get hear
&+Lit seems to be going well. You ask what I would do if you attacked from
&+Lyour area, would I back you, or fight you. My friend if you succeed in raising
&+Lyour fallen god then i think my decision would be to help you. The only
&+Lproblem in this area would be Duke Delwyn. He has an area close by here,
&+Lbut I think toegether we can take him. I hope to see you over his cold dead
&+Lcorpse.

&+L                                        The Baron of &n&+rBloodstone&n
~
