blood flesh red letter~
&+r   This letter is written in blood and on parchmant made of human flesh. It
&+rreads:

&+r   DeadLord Verinor,

&+r      You must think me crazy if you belive that I will show
&+r   you the secrets of how I created Maltheas. I did not spend
&+r   fifteen years of my life as a slave before Nakral, the
&+r   Crypt Keeper, so that he would teach me the arts of necro-
&+r   mancy, so that I could GIVE them to the likes of you. Also,
&+r   regarding your question about me giving you Maltheas, you
&+r   and your little puppy dog master can go to hell with that.


&+r                      Zrack, Master of the School of the Skeletal Hand&n
~
