crown sorcerer king~
&+m   This crown is what actually caused the ancient war of Light and Shadow.
&+mLong before the wars, before there was Toril, before there was Duris, before
&+mthere was Basternae there were many gods, and few heros. These were the days
&+mof legends. At this time there was a powerful sorcerer named Thindal Darkenion.
&+mHe was allready king over a huge area. However, he yearned for more, so he
&+mmade pacts with an infernal power, Sargon, the Lord of Shadows. He gave his
&+msoul over to the dark lord, and Sargon gave him powers, minions, and this
&+mcrown to seal their pact. It was thereafter called the Crown of the Sorcerer
&+mKing.
&+m    Thindal fought a powerful war versus the forces of light, and finally in
&+mhis dying breadth, as the forces of good entered his castle and his cities,
&+mhe opened a breach between our world and Sargon's. He put a crack in the
&+mbarrier that keeps the two areas apart. It was this crack that Sargon
&+mexploited a thousand years later to come to our world and wreck destruction.&n
~
