spellbook book legendary sorcerer martin llewelyn&n~
   Opening the spellbook you see that the first page has been written in
allready. It reads the following.

   Greetings and Well Met,

      If you are here then I pray that you are soldiers of Light and not the
   Darkness. If so then I have important information that you will need. I
   realize that my prison will not last forever, but it should serve long
   enough so that when you will have gotten here Sargon will be weakened,
   and therefore killable. You must know some things to be able to go
   farther and succeed. First, once you go in, you CANNOT get out. It is
   impossible. You may leave from here... now. But that is the only way,
   this room should have been opened to the normal travel spells upon my
   death. There are seperate prisons here, when we imprisoned Sargon, we
   also imprisoned his elite guards, so you must fight through them on
   your way to Sargon. I do not know what is ahead more then one room,
   although i can tell you that His personal demonic bodyguard is in the
   next room.

                                       Martin Llewellyn
~
