E
leather chest plate~
This piece of armor provides protection to the front and back of the wearer's
upper torso.  It's made of two seperate pieces of leather, reinforced with
heavy cloth padding.  Black leather straps lace up the side of the chest
plate, allowing the armor to be adjusted depending on the size of the
wearer.

The armor has been dyed and treated in the colors of the Imperial Guards
of the Jade Empire, with muted blues and greens that remind one of
the colors of the sea.
~
A
