E
haidate apron armor~
This leather haidate looks much like an ordinary apron, but it has been
specially treated and hardened to be worn as armor.  It provides the
wearer from the waist down to knee level, and has a piece for the front
and back of the user.  A simple belt of the same material holds the two
pieces together and straps of black cord can be used to adjust the
haidate depending on the size of the wearer.
~
