E
vial barba amarilla~
Barba Amarilla is made from the leaves of a rare flower, grown only in
certainly wetland areas.  In small doses it's usually harmless, but in
larger portions it can cause paralysis or even death.  It is a yellow
liquid with a sweet, lemony odor to it.  The odor itself is harmless,
although it can burn sensitive noses.
~
