E
book robert roberts diary~
&N   This simple black bound book seems to have been someone's diary at one
time. It tells the tale of young man, eager for knowledge, regardless of
the consequences, and his journey toward power. He speaks of the dark arts
of necromancy, and the raising of undead to do his bidding. It talks of how
he worked at a school, or college of some sort, rising through the ranks to
near graduation.
&N   However here it is almost as if the writer changes. The writer, Robert,
says that he was visiting the area around his school when he met a young
woman named Larra. He speaks of emotions and feelings the like of which
he has never had before. However appearently he was about to graduate,
and his master, a man named Zrack, was going to send him to Bloodstone, away
from his love. Finishing up his graduation experiment, something called his
'Soul Item,' he chances an escape to avoid the dark path itself and the loss
of his love. Here the diary ends.
~
E
