note blood~
&+r   The note is written in some sort of blood solution that works as ink and
&+rreads:


&+r     Zrack,

&+r        My old student, how goes the school that you set up? I have sent one
&+r     of my messengers to you, feel free to use him as a messenger back to me.
&+r     How is your research into dracoliches going? I hunger for your text.
&+r     The crypt has been expanded recently, you should come back and visit.
&+r     Everyone once in awhile some adventurers come and visit. I occasionally
&+r     have to create a doppleganger to take my place, they go killing all the
&+r     guards. Damn the those whom are called Thugan, Recya, Xanan, Tolm and Juv they always in the lead, destroying
&+r     my minions. You know how hard it is to get good help these days?
&+r        Did you destroy that student named Robert? I had a feeling he was
&+r     going to get out of control when he drew the line at the eighth circle
&+r     of animations.
&+r        By the way, please send me a copy of the procedure you used to raise
&+r     Malthease up, the mixture of golem and undead magics I find fascinating.

                                                   Nakral, The Crypt Keeper

&+r       P.S. I sent you some scrolls to help with the Malthease demonic weapon, to make it whole and complete,
&+r       Dralor can shape it into a hammer or dagger!
~
