&N Day of the Fallen Star, Fourth Month

&N   Hehe, Nakral, you would be proud, I have finally managed to build one of
&N those magical doors. Quite a step I think. I have coded to door to open
&N upon the command word 'Datherlion'.

&N Day of the Hunter, Seventh Month
&N    I had to deal with that pesky apprentice Robert yesterday. He tried to
&N leave me. I think he tried to get Marius to help rebel, but Marius is not
&N so stupid. I had to send Maltheus out to destroy him. Maltheas brought me
&N a ring, although it's not his soul object. I wish I knew what he did with
&N his soul ring, it could be a powerful object in controlling his spirit,
&N which I have cursed to wander the plains forever.


&N Today's date

&N    Today I animated Charringsdeath. Soon I will be ready. Too much time has
&N been wasted, finally I can destroy my enemy, it will be a good day soon.
~
