stone armor zaldran stonebreaker ironstar~
&+L   This ancient armor was forged in the early days of the dwarves. Originally
&+Lmade by the Ironstar dwarves for many of their most famous warriors, it now
&+Lis even more rare. Almost none of this powerful armor is known to exist any
&+Lmore.
&+L   This set belonged to one of the greatest of Ironstar kings. When
&+LCharringsdeath came he knew that even with the armor, he would die. So they
&+Ltook away the money and jewels and left the armor in the vault. He kept a
&+Lkey, and gave two keys to the vault to his children.
&+L   One of these children was Haldran. When he came and vanguished Char he
&+Ldied in the landslide of rock and stone. No one knew what happened to his key.
&+LThe last key is still rumored to be among the dwarves, and only they know for
&+Lsure who has it. The armor tells no tales. Many say that the armor itself has
&+Lanother name, the name of its first wearer.
~
