&+L    Zrack,

&n&+r       You have taken the great anti-paladin from the pits of hell
&+r    and raised him as some sort of undead creature. This is the
&+r    only letter you will recieve from me on this topic. Either
&+r    give him to us so that he may be with his brethren again,
&+r    or I will bring the armies of the Black Tower against you
&+r    and retake our ancient comrade, this is your warning.


   &+r                                Urian Shadowborn
~
