blade molten sword fury angel angels burning~
&+r   The sword's hilt is fairly normal, steel with a large crystal in the hilt,
&+rwrapped in leather, and the crossguard is made of dragon bone. The blade
&+rhowever is made of seething metal that is held together my some unknown
&+rmagical means. It emits a slow hissing sound.
&+r   Made as a weapon by Kossuth, Lord of the Elemental Plane of Fire, for the
&+rAnti-paladin Maltheas, it served him well during the Wars of Light and Shadow.
&+rIt was during this war that the old god Sargon walked the surface of the
&+rworld. Only after many years was he imprisoned in the small village of Dubneth.
&+rMaltheas survived the forces of darkness well, but was eventually hunted down,
&+ralong with his dark master, The Master of Nightmares, by Sir Dithyan and the
&+rElven Prince Amrothlin. Maltheas was killed in the battle by Sir Dithyan,
&+rwielding the Blade of the Paladins. At this time the blade was banished back
&+rto the Elemental Plane of Fire. No one knows what happened to the Master of
&+rNightmares.
&+r   When Maltheas was reanimated he summoned the blade back from the elemental
&+rplane again. By this time Kossuth was in his period of exile and Imix was
&+rthe master of the plane. He had the blade until whatever happened to bring
&+rit into your hands.
~
