githzerai stronghold shannanna parchment piece paper~
At 1st you will need to find the captain because he has the key to the magical door that hides the rift into their realm. He can be bribed for around 500 platinum pieces. Otherwise you will need to complete what other mundane task he needs.
Once you have entered the rift to their realms it will lead you to Limbo. Limbo can be a maze but I just headed east and find the air pocket. Once there looked ahead. Looking ahead will give you hints as to which direction to go next and eventually to the massive red and green Slaad blocking the exit up and out of Limbo.
After you defeat the Slaad take the relic he holds up and into the stronghold. The path is littered with creatures that protect the stronghold but you need to find the choosen one. Defeat him and move through the tunnels which can be a bit tricky and annoying. The stairs continue to a huge shadow monster guarding the second relic. Pick up the 2nd relic and move into the rift at the end of the stairs.
Now you are just outside the fortress of the githzerai. The watch leader guards the gates but does not hold the key. He holds the 3rd and last relic needed to trade for the fortress gate key. The spirit of Zerthimon will trade for the key and can be found wandering the black land mass.
After you have gained the key from the spirit he is of no more use so is best to slay him since you will need his heart as a sacrifice for final entrance.
Once inside you will be in the foyer with 3 directions to choose from. I prefer left to right as I am left handed. So the west past has 1 switch you must get to, then move on to the north path. On the north path there are 3 switches to pull, then move onto the last path to the east.
After you have headed east there is a fork you will want to stay west on. Find the statue and bow before it. It moves you to a tunnel with rooms of the old kings. Inside you will need to take the rings from their graves, 5 in all. Those goto the prophet for key. You will find 4 levers inside and suggest you pull each 1 on your way out of the tunnels.
Once you have gained the key from the prophet continue to the east path and find the mirror.
Stare into the mirror and move north, two west, and three north for the Vortex. Go down and finish that area and pull the final lever inside the orb. Return to the foyer for the final battle.
Head down from the foyer to Tayr-dryn and he requires the heartstone for access to his Throne Room. Ya will need to bleed on the altar to get it to move and unlock it with the shadow.

Good Luck!

P.S. You need to know these names at some point, Rrakkma, Raylen, Kraange, Tayr-dryn.
~
