apocalypse castle shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes~
Apocalypse Castle

Special Note: Its highly suggested that you have a conjurer who can prismatic cube, or two people who can make walls will surfice.

The Keeper at the entrance to the castle wants the skulls of the horsemen.

There is a portal you enter to get to the castle which puts you at the center of the Scorched Plains, and the 1st room is safe. Upon the plains is a blue slab that is four west and five south of the safe room. It will be hidden and needs to be pushed to move forward.

The signpost marks another safe room and east/southeast of it is a zombie who is looking for a old bracelet if you find it. North of the signpost is a deadly vampire who guards the center of town and access to the only portable room inside. The old bracelet is in the rocks just below the center of town.

There is many different items that can be collected but to move towards the end you will need to find 2 keys to the castle. These two keys are found on the warmaster west of center in the training center and one of the patrol leaders carries the other to the north.

Once you have collected the two keys head straight north to the castle from the center of town. The spectral knight holds the next key to the inner castle. You may have to provoke them to follow you.

Now that your in the castle find the Garden and the groundskeeper with the keys the four towers where each horsemen resides. It is guarded by wyrms and hydra's so watch your step. Take the keys and head to the towers which are on the east and west side.

Once inside and looking to slay the horsemen you should know that the horsemen do not chase but his dragon-horse does, so better to seperate them. Slay each of the four horsemen and just east of the garden is a secret path back to the keeper and the reward.

Good Luck!

P.S. Inside the castle you may find some unordinary visitors.
~
