jotunheim jot shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes~
Jotunheim

Quests:
   Olaf: hideous redmask
   Brunnhilde: Belt of Skulls or Cloak of Deva Feathers
   Grishnar: Scared Totem
   Rashnik: Standard of trolls
   Quelranor: Lightning Sword
   Sarimar: Valkyerie Sword
   Mimir: Golden Amulet
   Drow Emissary: Tankard of Ale
   Alchemist: Clump of Fireweed

Jotunheim can be found off Astral Plane.

Once you have entered the cold mountainous area you want to find the Icy Waterfall to the east. After going up the waterfall to the north is the Thyrm castle but you will need the key from Loki to gain access to his throne room. To the south is the mages camp which you need to know their dieties name, Kostchtchie, to gain access here.

To the east are the walls of Utgard. On the west side is a secret entrance I always use. The password is silverwing. Head east through and pay no attention to the fake Loki but instead find the hidden area above him where he is truely hidden. Claim the key from him and return to the castle of Thyrm.

Now that you have the key to the throne area just kill his guards and jarls then deal with his high priest. The God Thyrm can freeze you if he is directly engaged with you but its only temperary so be careful! He is cocky and will not chase you but instead mock you.

Good Luck!

P.S. Explore all of the hills for the out of the ordinary creatures.
~
