mazzolin shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes~
Mazzolin

Find the Throne Room of Mazzolin, it is north through the hallway and up the grad stairs. The king, queen, and warlord will not attack you so do not worry. There is a hidden entrance in the throne room behind the large map. To unlock it say, Mazzolin.

Head below the throne room and deal with the stormtroopers there. You will need a thief to pick the lock down into the sewers or someone large enough to bash the door.

When you enter the sewers you will come to a just a couple forks in the path. The 1st one you come to, stay south.
The 2nd one you come to, stay south.
The 3rd one you come to, stay east.
The 4th one you come to, stay south.

This path will take you directly to the end with a dragon who guards the rune stone.

The other paths are dead ends but may have hematite shards. The shards were pieces of a star that belong to Aeirayne. She is a Grey Elf who was captured and resides north of the stormtroopers. She will reward you if you return all five shards for the sleeves of zephyrs.

If you end up on the Blasted Plain of Rock find the pool of tar, not the pool of acid, and it will return you to the entrance of the hallway you began in.

Good Luck!

P.S. In the sewers are blugrul of various spellcasting abilities. They can overwelm you and need to be taken down so procede with caution.

P.S.S. The hematite orbs are hidden in area's that seem that there is no escape. Rub them to escape.
~
