shadamehr keep shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes~
Shadamehr Keep

It can be found on the Ethereal Plane near the Void in Time inside the Dreggan Woods.

From the Void in Time you need to move east, two north, and 1 west to enter the Dreggan Woods.

From the Entrance to Dreggan Woods follow these directions as you can easily get lost in them:

Eight North
Two East
Five North
One West
Two East
Two North
Six East
Three North
Two East
Two North

This will get you to the Entrance to Shadamehr Keep. It is very vacant due to the beholder who holds the key to the formal hallway. Behind the door is a shadow dragons lair who guards the key for Merkus the death knights abode.

Merkus is protected by two banshee who follow him if he is chases his attacker but can be lured into chasing someone who can use a damage over time type spell against them.

If someone is huge or bigger they maybe have some success bashing Merkus but his abode is a specially designed room and has the same elements of the plane of fire.

Good Luck!

P.s. Try to disarm him if he is wielding, and search his vault for treasure.
~
