celestial plane shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes~
Celestial Plane

There is access to Celestial Plane on both the Astral Plane and Ethereal Plane. You will need to find the portal blazing with brilliant divine energy that moves about the planes.

Things you need to know beforehand:
The creatures are color coded to help you recognize which ones you will need to slay. If you are a part of Good Races then you will want to slay the red and black creatures, and if you are part of Evil Races you will want to slay the blue and white creatures.

There is one portable room named Cosmic Storm.
There is a glowing portal that will send you to the Astral Plane.

These are the Directions from the different Landmarks found on the Plane:
FROM PORTAL: To Cosmic 2nw,To Tear n2wu, To Vortex d2en, To Stream 2n3end, To Rift de.
FROM COSMIC: to portal e2s, To Tear wsu, to vortex 2wds, To Stream 4end, To Rift 2e2sd
FROM TEAR: to portal d2es, to cosmic dne, to vortex wu, to rift s2wu
FROM VORTEX: to portal s2wu, to cosmic nu3e, to tear ed, to rift sw
FROM STREAM: to portal us3w2s, to cosmic us4w
FROM RIFT: to portal wu, to cosmic u2w2n

To begin you will need to find 1 of 2 white devils that has a hellish crystal. This crystal unlocks the door hidden in A Tear in Celestia which can be uncovered by entering the rift in the room. Continue Up into the rift with caution.
   The rift has many devils and at its end is Cerberus who holds the next key a sliver of anti-matter. After claiming the sliver move north and up to return to the grid.

Next you will want to move to the Vortex of Dark Matter which is west and up from the Tear room. By entering vortex it will uncover the door you will unlock with the sliver. Some of the rooms in this section are underwater and some are magic dead areas. Take your time moving down through this area as it can be difficult. You need to kill Saggitarius A* for a splintered life shard to unlock the next area. To leave this area you move 3 down and 1 up after slaying him to get to the grid.

Return to the Cosmic Storm which is east, north, up, 3 east after returning to grid. From there you need to reach the A Variance in the Life Stream. This is four east, north, and down from the Cosmic Storm.

Once at the Life Stream begin by entering lifestream to reveal the door you will use the shard to unlock with. In this area there are some creatures that are not aggressive and none of them will chase you so take your time moving through. At the end of the current is a group of creatures you can slay that protect a door to their south. Enter the room through the door and each person in your group will need to manually move down to get to the next section even though a exit does not exist.

You should now be in the Palace of the Titans. Here you will need to collect keys moving back and forth from one area and back to the same one. There are 4 towers on the outer wall and they will be opened in the following order, NW, SE, SW, and NE.

The key for the NW tower is on a titan all north from the room you entered from the Stream. Collect the key from the tower guardian and return to the door that the titan who had the key for the NW Tower was standing in front of. Unlock and move inside to slay Atlas. Up and West of Atlas is a guard post where 1 of the guards holds the next key for the SE tower. Collect that key and get the key from the SE tower guardian and return to Atlas' room.
After the SE tower take its key to the room Up, South, Up, East from Atlas' room and slay the statue and collect its key. Take the statue's key to the SW tower and slay its guardian.
Once you have collected the SW tower guardian's key return to Atlas' room and move Up, South, Up, and North. Destroy the titan magistrate, Metatron to the west, and Cronus to the north. Take the key and collect the NE tower guardian's key and return to Metatron's room to unlock the last door. Inside the room north of Metatron's is a statue you need to rub to return to the Celestia Wargrounds grid.

The last section is the Deep Blue Rift which is South, East, and Down after rubbing the statue. You need to enter the rift to reveal the hidden entrance and use the blue shard to unlock it. Continue down into the rift killing the different souls that are disguised as common creatures. You will find the creature Malevolence behind a door at its ends. He is not difficult but can transport those who are engaged on it back onto the Wargrounds grid. Once he is destroyed search for the final room.

Good Luck!

P.S. It is highly suggested that you clear as many of your opposing creatures off the wargrounds grid as you can.
~
