shanaanaa parchment piece paper note notes sky ultarium city~
The Sky city of Ultarium

What you need to know:
  This place will repopulate while you are still inside.
  Bring atleast 200 platinum.

Begin by finding the Heavens Plaza with its beautiful sparkling fountain.
From there you will need to search the room two south of it for a secret
entrance. Use the entrance and head into Grudat's Storeroom and purchase
the sunstone key. Then return to the Plaza.

The Gates of Appollyon Fortress is three south and far to the east from
the plaza. Use the key to obtain entrance to the fortress. The entry hall
has several agressive guards and dogs so use caution. Straight to your
east are the stairs to the next level but you will need to gain the key
from the lieutenant who resides in his room in the southeast corner of
the hall.

Upon claiming the second floor key you should still use caution moving
onto the second floor as it is packet with more guards. the bottom of the
third floor stairwell is just to your east. Once you have gained access
to the third story the number of guards are sparce, however Blaze the
council guardian is a very capable fighter. He is known for his whip
named "Cometstrike."

Above him is Plume Meteorhand the siegemaster who holds the key to the
councilors hallway. Deal with him and return to the guardians room where
Blaze stands. Use caution continuing east from here. There are some
attendants and councilors who can be a tough fight if they swarm you.
You will want to claim each soul from Ignor, Strata, Zeenium, and Omoona.

When you are ready to leave the council chambers you can stomp the pad on
the balcony.

Good Luck!

P.S. There are a few people who want the souls of those four. The most
popular is the Pandora Box. The creature can be found behind a statue
that is at the end of a mountain trail that is just south of the Gates
of Appollyon Fortress. You will need to touch the statue to gain access.
~
