This sign contains information about the items for sale in this store:
&+W 1) &+ga M&+Ga&+Wg&+Gi&+gc&+Ga&+Wl &+GGreen &+gMu&+Gshro&+gom from the &+GSylvan &+yWoods&n
&+C-This item gives 1 level, up to 46, to any character that eats it.&n

&+W 2) &+ya tightly wrapped vellum scroll named '&+LFix&+y'&n
&+C-This item will repair any single item which it is recited on, even if it is otherwise unrepairable.&n
&+C Note: This will &=LCNOT&N &+Cwork in no magic rooms.&n

&+W 3) &+Wa &+mm&+My&+Ys&+Bt&+Gc&+Ra&+Gl &+MFaerie &+Wbag of &+Lstolen loot&n
&+C-This item contains a random item from the entire world of &+rDuris&+C. When opened, the bag will disappear
&+C and the item will magically appear in your inventory.&n

&+W 4) &+Ya r&+ro&+Yb&+re &+Yof a &+mN&+We&+Mt&+Wh&+me&+Wr&+Mi&+Wl &+rBa&+Ytt&+rle&+Y M&+rag&+Ye&n
&+C-This powerful item grants the wearer secret abilities of the battle mages. When wearing the robe, a person
&+C will be able to perform melee combat manouvers even while casting a spell! In addition, the robe also
&+C grants its wearer super-human strength among other things. &+R(Note, this item does not work on multiclassed chars)

&+W 5) &+La &+Gbottle &+Lof &+GT&+go&+GR&+gM&+Ge&+gN&+GT&+ge&+GD &+gS&+Goul&+gs&n
&+C-This item allows the person who quaffs it to call upon the spirit realm for help in retrieving their corpse. Upon drinking this bottle of spirits, the character will attempt to open up a portal allowing them a 1 time access back to the location of their &+Rmost recent&+C corpse. &+R(Note: this item will not work if the result of your death was a PVP situation)&n

&+W 6) &+ca &+Cbr&+Will&+Bia&+Wnt &+cset of &+rLantan &+CScientific&+L Tools&n
&+C-This item, direct from the far reaches of the brilliant Lantan Gnomes, is an analysis device which greatly assists one when breaking down an item as part of the salvage process. Having this item in your inventory will greatly increase one's chances at creating a &+yrecipe &+Cduring deconstruction of the item.&n

&+W 7) &+Lthe &+ge&+Gy&+ge&+Gs &+Lof the &+gGre&+Gat For&+gest&n
&+C-This item grants its wearer forest sight (the ability to see long distances) while in forest map rooms.&n

&+W 8) &+Ca &+Wbottle &+Cof &+GPa&+gs&+Lt Exp&+gerien&+Gces&n
&+C-This item grants the imbiber &+W75 epic&+C points.&n
~
